# golang.org/x/crypto/openpgp is deprecated as unsafe by design (GO-2026-5932).
# Trivy flags the whole x/crypto module, but nothing here imports openpgp, so
# no binary contains it. The fix is an untagged x/crypto commit; drop this line
# once Dependabot raises x/crypto to a tagged release that has it. The expiry
# makes the finding come back on its own if that is missed.
GO-2026-5932 exp:2026-12-31
